sequenceDiagram
    %% SD5 - Reveal and accept the estimates
    %% Stories: 9, 10, 11, 12, 33, 36
    %% Description: The estimates are shown to everyone at once, early if the moderator decides so; the moderator then accepts the average or the agreed estimate.
    actor M as Moderator
    actor EP as Estimator (person)
    participant R as Round
    participant I as Item
    participant ES as Estimate

    opt not all estimators have played yet [9]
        M->>R: show estimates now
    end
    R->>I: revealEstimates()
    I->>ES: reveal()
    I-->>M: all estimates at once, with who gave them [33, 36]
    I-->>EP: all estimates at once, with who gave them [33, 36]
    Note over M,ES: if all cards are equal, the estimate field is pre-filled [11]
    alt accept the average [10]
        M->>R: accept average
        R->>I: acceptAverage()
    else enter the agreed estimate [12]
        M->>R: accept agreed estimate
        R->>I: accept(value)
    end
